# Exclude large APK files from Vercel build to avoid 250MB limit
# Total APK size: ~516 MB (prelazi 250MB limit)

# IMPORTANT: Keep public/apk/** for static serving via Vercel CDN
# DO NOT ignore public/apk/** - these files are served statically

# Private APK files (exclude from build - served via API endpoints)
private/apk/**/*.apk
private/apk/**/*.APK
private/apk/apps/**/*.apk
private/apk/apps/**/*.APK
private/apk/apps/jurist_qr_app/**/*.apk
private/apk/apps/worker_app/**/*.apk

# Other APK files (but NOT in public/apk/ - public/apk/** is explicitly allowed)
# Note: *.apk would ignore ALL .apk files including public/, so we only ignore private/
# If you add APK files elsewhere, add specific ignore rules here

# Other large files
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar
